        "turn_total": 60261.2
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "caller",
      "text": "Sa BDO po ako nagbabayad, over the counter.",
      "at": "2026-10-02T07:03:13.099868+00:00",
      "tool_calls": [],
      "timings_ms": {}
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Sige po, BDO over the counter. May bagong sitwasyon po ba kayo \u2014 new baby, marriage, o iba pa \u2014 na aapektuhan nito ang beneficiary ninyo?",
      "at": "2026-10-02T07:03:13.483447+00:00",
      "tool_calls": [],
      "timings_ms": {
        "llm_0": 383.5,
        "turn_total": 383.5
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "caller",
      "text": "Teka po, baka mag-lapse na po yung akin? Nahuli po kasi ako ng bayad.",
      "at": "2026-10-02T07:03:13.488078+00:00",
      "tool_calls": [],
      "timings_ms": {}
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Huwag po muna kayong mag-alala, Mr. Santos. May 30 days po kayong grace period from the due date, so active pa rin po ang policy ninyo within that period. Gusto po ninyong i-check ko kung kailan exactly yung due date ninyo?",
